    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Pause held the view still. Seeking backward and forward let me find the relevant moment without waiting through the entire recording."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
