    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Later, ls checked the same 131-byte file and cat displayed its two lines of lab text."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
