    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The command list says rm was blocked; replay adds the context that the user stayed connected and inspected the file afterward. That helps explain the outcome."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
