          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Find the command, open details, and click Replay: no separate session search or manual alignment within a long recording was needed. Records and screen context made events easier to understand."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This exercise focused on reviewing completed work. Within QueryPie I could follow the person, commands, and output, using recorded screens rather than relying only on memory for later questions or audits."
        }
      ]
    },
